{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_014_02_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:66fec0f76dc7413574aeed9e8f48245ec24ccf0d1c9c8f592f2e9d4ab4c73319",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffa21dd66303ead1480628e71b669ca60fe2ef3877cfa5e28f913a44d9b429bb",
      "text": "你们明明说了要帮我庆祝的，\n生日当天看来有点悬了。抱歉啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e6b17b0e20a652513961bd339f5714f16339d10a24212c6dc2f6a7650aa3399",
      "text": "没关系。\n我过生日的时候，也改了日程吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:920113bcbcf814ce12bd5debb65ec793f08250c712ea5e973451003639b6a8a0",
      "text": "是啊。英雄先生的庆祝，\n我们也重新定个日子办吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56704d36ba0121363e6c1971893cb320452bf68511e98b9f85f0dcf187c2f70b",
      "text": "哈哈，谢谢你们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:efe481d49693b6384900a7c8cb2f9d63dc0c1996840712bfe01604df9ff7af51",
      "text": "不过，生日那天有工作进来也是个好兆头啊。\n这是新一年的开始，我会好好加油的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c80612b42fcc6152c4dc21aa5201fe037481460a2f6c39bdedd852dda7dc9837",
      "text": "啊啊，为你加油。全力以赴去干吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f870571849340aabe35a9fb4f14eef3d3401e68d49b68088d988f1552b4c92a7",
      "text": "我们也会为了给英雄先生准备庆祝，\n全力以赴加油的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_b:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ecf9489fbe8953a96b788238fc67d7aaeb9ef2aeed016548b3dcfc2890002911",
      "text": "我会和诚司先生一起好好庆祝的，\n敬请期待吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_b:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e97e889d6819e29f78d48624165803c364e32133a5d40f67289e9a5a023fb322",
      "text": "多谢。我很期待哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
